    "title": "Is ‘The Bachelorette’ cast list out? One rumored Florida contestant",
    "text": "Feb. 17, 2026, 6:08 a.m. ETTaylor Frankie Paul, a TikTok influencer and star of \"The Secret Lives of Mormon Wives,\" will be the next \"Bachelorette.\"Paul is the first lead to be chosen from outside of the \"Bachelor\" franchise.The new season will premiere on Sunday, March 22, 2026, moving from its usual Monday night slot.The rumored cast list includes a potential contestant from Miami, Florida.The next new season of \"The Bachelorette\" is coming up in a little over a month, and there could be a contestant from Florida vying for Taylor Frankie Paul's heart.Paul will be the first \"Bachelorette\" from outside of the \"Bachelor\" franchise, coming to the show from her smash-hit Hulu reality show \"The Secret Lives of Mormon Wives.\"Miami resident Jenn Tran held the title last season, and the show took a brief hiatus, with fans wondering if the \"Bachelor\" spinoff would return at all. But in September, ABC revealed Paul as the newest lead.The Utah-based influencer and reality TV star announced her upcoming role on an episode of the \"Call Her Daddy\" podcast in September.\"Surreal. It has not hit me right now in this moment,\" she said. \"I'm just thinking about it, and it's not real. And it's not going to be until I think the limo is pulling up, you know? And meeting the people.\"Here's what we know about the 22nd season of \"The Bachelorette,\" when it will premiere, who Taylor Frankie Paul is and the rumored cast of contestants.Who is the new 'Bachelorette'? Who is Taylor Frankie Paul?Taylor Frankie Paul is a 31-year-old mom of three, TikTok influencer and reality TV star from Utah.She and her friends, also Mormon mothers living in Utah, started creating TikTok videos together in 2022 and tagged them all with #MomTok, which became the name of their influencer group. The group exploded to fame following a \"soft-swinging\" scandal later that year, in which Taylor, one of the other women, and their husbands were involved.She took to TikTok to tell her side of the story, and users on the platform became intrigued with the concept of these religion-centered Mormon moms being involved in something so taboo.Not long after, Hulu picked up the story and released the first season of \"The Secret Lives of Mormon Wives\" in September 2024, a reality show about a group of friends (and frenemies), mainly centered on Taylor's relationships with her ex-husband and then-boyfriend.When does the next season of 'The Bachelorette' come out? How, when to watch. See trailer\"The Bachelorette\" is moving to a different day of the week. Although the show normally airs on Monday nights, the season 22 premiere will air on Sunday, March 22, 2026.It is still unknown what time the premiere will be, but episodes will stream on Hulu the following day.Watch 'The Bachelorette' with Disney Bundle'The Bachelorette' 2026 cast, what we knowABC has not officially confirmed the cast list for the upcoming season of \"The Bachelorette,\" as of Feb. 16, but Cosmopolitan reported a list of contestants on Feb. 10.ABC did post a Facebook teaser in October (since deleted) featuring men who “may” appear in the upcoming season, including one Floridian. The two lists are the same.Here are the men who will likely appear on the upcoming season, according to Cosmopolitan:Aaron Kahng, 32, from Bellevue, WashingtonBrad Ledford, 29, from Asheville, North CarolinaBrandon Perce, 28, from West Allis, WisconsinCasey Hux, 30, from Midlothian, VirginiaChris Braden, 34, from Goleta, CaliforniaChristopher Wood, 35, from Rowlett, TexasClayton Johnson, 36, from Nashville, TennesseeConrad Ukropina, 32, from Pasadena, CaliforniaDave Pigott, 44, from Thornton, ColoradoDoug Mason, 28, from Hailey, IdahoJoe Ceraulo, 27, from Syosset, New YorkJohnnie LaRossa, 30, from Massapequa, New YorkJosh Harward, 28, from Provo, UtahKevin Montero, 32, from Miami, FloridaLew Evans, 32, from Salt Lake City, UtahMalik Evans, 30, from Brooklyn, New YorkMarcus Richardson, 28, from Elmont, New YorkMatt Carroll, 43, from Carmel, IndianaMichael Baba, 37, from Lake Forest, CaliforniaMike Turitto, 36, from Lavallette, New JerseyRichard Van De Water, 35, from Charleston, South CarolinaRod Strozier, 35, from Apple Valley, MinnesotaRonn Perez, 28, from San Francisco, CaliforniaShane Parton, 28, from Roswell, GeorgiaSpencer Clegg, 35, from Vineyard, UtahTrenten Merrill, 35, from Laguna Niguel, CaliforniaWhat is 'The Secret Lives of Mormon Wives' about?Premiering in September 2024, the Hulu show follows the scandalous world of a group of Mormon mom influencers, dubbed \"#MomTok.\"The show came after Paul told her TikTok viewers in 2022 that members of her tight-knit Mormon friend group had been \"soft-swinging,\" a practice where couples allegedly shared sexual partners but didn't go \"all the way.\"What ensued was calamity from all corners: partners breaking up or divorcing, people getting together, families dismantling, alliances switching, gossip videos and sordid details leaking.The first season of the show chronicles the aftermath and fallout of that scandal. The second season, which premiered in May 2025, follows the relationships between the women in the friend group and their interactions with their own families and each other. The third season, which premiered in November 2025, mainly followed one of the Momtoker's emotional affair with a \"Vanderpump Villa\" star.",
